.TH AERO-NVME-WEAR 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-nvme-wear \- NVMe drive endurance profiler, TBW tracker and flash wear telemetry
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-nvme-wear
[B\-\-guiR] [B\-\-helpR] [B\-\-versionR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-nvme-wear
is a native developer utility designed for the Aero Linux operating system.
NVMe drive endurance profiler, TBW tracker and flash wear telemetry.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-gui
Launch the application in standalone graphical mode.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print program version information and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display brief usage synopsis and available command-line switches.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AERO_DEBUG
When set to 1, enables verbose diagnostic output to standard error.
